         MACRO
         RDREGN &R
         GBLA  &RDRV
         LCLA  &I
         LCLC  &S
&RDRV    SETA  -1
&S       SETC  '&R'
         AIF   (K'&R LT 2).SEARCH
         AIF   ('&R'(1,1) NE 'R').SEARCH
&S       SETC  '&R'(2,K'&R-1)
.SEARCH  AIF   ('&S' EQ '&I').FOUND
&I       SETA  &I+1
         AIF   (&I LT 16).SEARCH
         MEXIT
.FOUND   ANOP
&RDRV    SETA  &I
         MEND
